  "notModeled": [
    "analog inputs and reference (the result is always the 0 V code on both channels)",
    "OF pin: low = offset binary (modeled, 0 V reads 0x800), high = two's complement (0 V reads 0x000) not modeled",
    "OEB: the clocked bus has one output enable; OEA gates both the A (DA11-DA0) and B (DB11-DB0) data pins in the model, OEB is ignored",
    "INT/EXT REF reference select (analog only)",
    "pipeline latency of 6 clock cycles (the code is constant)",
    "clock frequency limits and power-down exit time",
    "vcc is the VDR range (2.35 V to VD 5.25 V); CLK/PD/OE are referenced to VD (4.75-5.25 V)"
